{"content":[{"c":["BOZEZ"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of a pair of distinctive rocks (Seneh was the other) flanking the road between Michmash and Gaba. Jonathan and his armor bearer scaled one of these crags to take on a Philistine outpost (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.14.4","r":"1Sam.14.4","rawR":"1Sam.14.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.14.4","value":"1Sam.14.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 14:4"},"). The two rocks are still visible in the modern Wadi Suweinet. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Seneh_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Seneh_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Seneh_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Seneh"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Bozez","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Sm 14:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.14.4","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.14.4","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.14.4"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5916172e1d3fe0caee9b4f1f248d0631dccd8be0cc65b7e77f56f45d37048040","sourceItemName":"Bozez","sourceItemOrder":395,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Bozez","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bozez","title":"Bozez","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}